{"4270630":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"In My Bubble •°","steam_appid":4270630,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5541940],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save dreams from the all-devouring shadows in a world that can no longer sleep.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One sheep… two sheep… people used to drift off counting sheep. But the sheep who delivered dreams have been stolen by a shadow that devours the world. As people stop falling asleep, the world loses its balance. Nightmares awaken, and the Dream Factory falls silent. Now you must purify the shadow-stained sheep and restart the broken chain of dreams. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a little lamb who escaped the nightmare—and bring back a dazzling morning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/db7fc3a999f593bb268f5de857822d05.poster.avif?t=1795398054\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/db7fc3a999f593bb268f5de857822d05.webm?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/db7fc3a999f593bb268f5de857822d05.mp4?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blow, Pop, and Bounce!<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/4d647232762fe7eadc5870279d806ac0.poster.avif?t=1795398054\" width=300 height=186 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/4d647232762fe7eadc5870279d806ac0.webm?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/4d647232762fe7eadc5870279d806ac0.mp4?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/f26b063d51ed4ad8d1720bc2662a54e0.poster.avif?t=1795398054\" width=300 height=186 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/f26b063d51ed4ad8d1720bc2662a54e0.webm?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/f26b063d51ed4ad8d1720bc2662a54e0.mp4?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your mysterious Bubble Stick to fight corrupted sheep and nightmares. Cleanse them with a flashy Bubble Dash, turning them back into dream couriers once more. Bubbles are both powerful weapons and springy platforms. Create, ride, and pop bubbles to cross gaps, climb terrain, and move freely through the world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dazzling Morning After the Nightmare<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defeat towering bosses and return warm sunlight to the world. Thanks to your courage, people will finally fall asleep again—and wake up to a bright, lively morning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/828d3089a833ea6864964be63662e140.poster.avif?t=1795398054\" width=300 height=334 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/828d3089a833ea6864964be63662e140.webm?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/828d3089a833ea6864964be63662e140.mp4?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save dreams from the all-devouring shadows in a world that can no longer sleep.<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One sheep… two sheep… people used to drift off counting sheep. But the sheep who delivered dreams have been stolen by a shadow that devours the world. As people stop falling asleep, the world loses its balance. Nightmares awaken, and the Dream Factory falls silent. Now you must purify the shadow-stained sheep and restart the broken chain of dreams. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a little lamb who escaped the nightmare—and bring back a dazzling morning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/db7fc3a999f593bb268f5de857822d05.poster.avif?t=1795398054\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/db7fc3a999f593bb268f5de857822d05.webm?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/db7fc3a999f593bb268f5de857822d05.mp4?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blow, Pop, and Bounce!<\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/4d647232762fe7eadc5870279d806ac0.poster.avif?t=1795398054\" width=300 height=186 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/4d647232762fe7eadc5870279d806ac0.webm?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/4d647232762fe7eadc5870279d806ac0.mp4?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/f26b063d51ed4ad8d1720bc2662a54e0.poster.avif?t=1795398054\" width=300 height=186 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/f26b063d51ed4ad8d1720bc2662a54e0.webm?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4270630\/extras\/f26b063d51ed4ad8d1720bc2662a54e0.mp4?t=1795398054\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your mysterious Bubble Stick to fight corrupted sheep and nightmares. Cleanse them with a flashy Bubble Dash, turning them back into dream couriers once more. Bubbles are both powerful weapons and springy platforms. Create, ride, and pop bubbles to cross gaps, climb terrain, and move freely through the world.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Dazzling Morning After the Nightmare<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Defeat towering bosses and return warm sunlight to the world. Thanks to your courage, people will finally fall asleep again—and wake up to a bright, lively morning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo